["rarity"]="1/400 – 1/60",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="Increased to 1/75 while on a Slayer assignment . Increased to 1/395 (1/60 on-task) when carrying a Sophanem slayer dungeon drop enhancer ."}}},{["name"]="Khopesh of the Kharidian",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/500 on task; 1/5,000 off task",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/500 on task; 1/5,000 off task",["notes"]="Base rates; Slayer-task status matters.",["condition"]="Base rates, 23 November 2026"}},["rateSource"]="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/patch-notes-late-game-rebalance"},{["name"]="Corrupted gem",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/500 on task",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/500 on task",["notes"]="Slayer tasks only.",["condition"]="Base rates, 23 November 2026"}},["rateSource"]="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/patch-notes-late-game-rebalance"},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #1",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 200 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 399 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #2",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 600 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 799 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #3",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 1,000 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 1,199 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #4",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 1,400 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 1,599 kills."}}},{["name"]="The Magister's Journal #5",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/200 – 1/1",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="The books are dropped in order; the next book can only be received after reading the previous book. The higher a player's killcount, the higher chance of a book being dropped. After 1,800 total kills of corrupted creatures and soul devourers , the denominator begins to decrease by 1 for every further kill until the item is guaranteed to be obtained at 1,999 kills."}}},{["name"]="Sealed clue scroll (elite)",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="99/25,600",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="99/25,600",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="There's a 1% chance an elite clue scroll will be upgraded to a master clue scroll."}}},{["name"]="Sealed clue scroll (master)",["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/25,600",["variants"]={{["quantity"]="1",["rarity"]="1/25,600",["section"]="Tertiary",["notes"]="There's a 1% chance